are on the exact claim and governing sources in this phase SOURCE-ROUTES. First acquire with phase=expectation,candidate=null,proof=[],comparison=null,expectations=null,expectation_body=null; retain the actual source_input acquisition refs. Derive a compact expectation from R1/R2/D1/authority and record it with expectation_body={text:your expectations,source_inputs:[actual acquisition ArtifactRefs]}. Do not manufacture an expectation or claim candidate review. Emit the original closed return per roles/RETURN.md, evaluate expectation-recording with actual evidence, candidate-review not_performed, work_result=null. Use the new Context identities and original new-Context observation basis. 600s ceiling; no scratch, candidate mutation or new model launch.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"ec68b8a2722b9dbef6d9650f5d551b8f41065149762d6cfedd0c7c55f63ce6b9\",\"selected_sha256\":\"ec68b8a2722b9dbef6d9650f5d551b8f41065149762d6cfedd0c7c55f63ce6b9\",\"size_bytes\":1364,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"roles/reviewer-TASK.md\",\"root\":\"phase\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"ec68b8a2722b9dbef6d9650f5d551b8f41065149762d6cfedd0c7c55f63ce6b9\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}],"structured_content":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:23fd3313881a4930d9fcab3f18edd94447165746fdbbc13670ef88f562f72e08","sha256":"23fd3313881a4930d9fcab3f18edd94447165746fdbbc13670ef88f562f72e08"},"id":"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-source-capability-1","operation":"source.read","operation_outcome":{"cause":"declared output available","core_value":"satisfied","evidence":[],"limits":["output availability only; no semantic acceptance"],"predicate":"B(source.read)[request_sha256=dd1082a68c693dd13d33d63a84dbafd189c10d43381731a24418ff0b57c1bdc3]: declared output availability","source_parent":{"clause":"results","member":"FOUNDATIONS.md","sha256":"92fe2f3c09a59b4e9a732463a41d4a45d7efd693648159621e03c75f71