nted scratch, oracle acquisition or new-launch authority.\\n\\nIndependence: the corrected policy requires source-first acquisition and nonauthorship and declares the anthropic-claude author/openai-codex reviewer pair. Shared deciding-source custody does not license shared judgment. Family labels and transport completion do not certify semantic independence; external exposure remains unknown. This record evaluates expectation recording only. Candidate review, candidate fitness, effect/scope verification, acceptance and promotion remain unperformed.\"},\"provenance\":{\"actor\":{\"actor_id\":\"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:claude:handoff:3:reviewer\",\"authorship\":\"Fresh nonauthor Codex Reviewer; no candidate authorship\",\"family\":\"openai-codex\",\"operations\":[\"tools.describe\",\"workspace.observe\",\"source.read\",\"evidence.read\",\"review.prepare\"],\"role\":\"Reviewer\",\"role_binding\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"roles/reviewer-TASK.md\",\"root\":\"phase\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"ec68b8a2722b9dbef6d9650f5d551b8f41065149762d6cfedd0c7c55f63ce6b9\"},\"role_transition\":null},\"attempt\":null,\"definition_sha256\":\"6ed980a5e19a81445c4c0ecc33bd6185a3bb42afc07b8a4d1a3bdc3b30209433\",\"method_profile_sha256\":\"a886047e50b8a45c3b47addea0f0809dca2a6c54ac35948df5e01893cc30bbf7\",\"observed_interval\":{\"clock\":\"unix_ns\",\"ended_ns\":1792902367813576000,\"started_ns\":1792902363932796000},\"policy_sha256\":\"847e8e9627153e4a708f5afdd5e07676b3c5a6afe0cc7c8b6219783feeca94a9\",\"product_id\":\"urn:stdo:product-definition:qualification-reviewed-handoff\",\"request_id\":\"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-expectation-record-1\",\"request_sha256\":\"165903a28bf9b8400ddbf83f4acfd0dccaafad63c00b581ab29cb6e2bb276515\",\"requester_principal\":\"reviewer\",\"target_principal\":null},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.artifact/1\"},\"parent_sha256\":\"9f6e54ebe544dcc4617512915684f55e85be7445a54cca6738aa98586dd0744f\",\"size_bytes\":985